  "description": "Rustic Autumn Farmhouse Wallpaper Digital Paper Pack\nWarm Country Charm & Vintage Fall-Inspired Farmhouse Wallpaper Collection\n❖ Includes 12 High-Resolution Designs\n❖ Delivered in PNG Format\n❖ Dimensions: 8.5″ × 11″ (2550 × 3300 pixels)\n❖ 300 DPI for Crisp, Professional Print Quality\n❖ Features Rustic Farmhouse Patterns, Weathered Wood Textures, Autumn Foliage, Vintage Country Details, and Cozy Seasonal Wallpaper Designs\n❖ File Size: 8–18 MB per Page\n❖ Color Palette: Burnt Orange, Rust Red, Mustard Yellow, Antique Cream, Warm Beige, Muted Brown, and Dusty Olive Green\n❖ Opaque (Non-Transparent) Backgrounds\n🍂 Bring Timeless Country Warmth to Your Autumn Crafts\nCreate a cozy countryside atmosphere with this Rustic Autumn Farmhouse Wallpaper digital paper collection. Inspired by vintage farmhouse interiors and the natural beauty of fall, these designs blend weathered textures, warm seasonal hues, rustic patterns, and charming country-inspired details. The combination of earthy colors and aged finishes gives each page a welcoming, lived-in character that works beautifully for junk journals, scrapbooking, planner inserts, memory books, collage art, greeting cards, printable stationery, seasonal decorations, and DIY paper crafts. Whether you’re designing a rustic fall journal or adding farmhouse charm to handmade projects, this collection brings the comforting spirit of autumn to every creation.",
